{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 41, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "**A Whirlwind Adventure in Japan**\n\nLast month, I traded my comfy sofa for a bullet train and embarked on a dream trip to Japan. My journey began in Tokyo, where neon-lit streets and towering skyscrapers greeted me. I lost myself in the bustling crowds of Shibuya Crossing, then found peace in the serene gardens of Meiji Shrine. At night, the dazzling lights of Akihabara beckoned, and I spent hours exploring anime shops and trying my hand at arcade games.\n\nFrom Tokyo, I hopped on the Shinkansen to Kyoto, where ancient traditions met modern elegance. I wandered through the golden gates of Kinkaku-ji, marveled at the intricate details of Kiyomizu-dera, and sipped matcha tea in a tranquil tea house. A visit to Fushimi Inari’s thousands of red torii gates left me in awe—each step felt like stepping into a storybook.\n\nMy last stop was Osaka, a city bursting with energy. Street food stalls lined Dotonbori, and I indulged in takoyaki, okonomiyaki, and more flavors than I could name. The vibrant street performers and lively atmosphere made it impossible to stay still.\n\nJapan was a masterclass in contrasts—futuristic cities coexisting with timeless temples, cutting-edge tech alongside age-old rituals. Every meal, every temple, and every train ride felt like a page from a different chapter of a beautifully written book. If you ever get the chance, go. You won’t regret it.", "logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.06942010670900345}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.3157995045185089}, {"token": " Wh", "logprob": -0.04239610955119133}, {"token": "irl", "logprob": -0.018030313774943352}, {"token": "wind", "logprob": -7.462222856702283e-05}, {"token": " Adventure", "logprob": -1.0522644519805908}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.08214899152517319}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.004411489237099886}, {"token": "**\n\n", "logprob": -0.1192852184176